Category: IT Services 

Location:    

For an international organization in Manila, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE (Senior) Solution Architect. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. 

Candidates need to be able to work in the normal European office hours. Example 9AM Europe time equals 12:30PM Sri Lanka time.

Tasks and deliverables:

- Define, implement, and execute processes for the definition, maintenance and compliance monitoring of the Enterprise Architecture for Migrant Solutions;

- Design, plan and implement the software solution landscape of the Migrant solutions to support business process and product prioritization; and ensure alignment with the enterprise architectural roadmap and the organization’s vision;

- Formulate plans, timelines, milestones and enumerate deliverables for assigned projects; Create proof of concepts, architectural analysis, design and implementation of web-based applications & services;

- Provide technical guidance on the implementation of internal and external application interfaces, track risks and mitigation measures and ensure that solutions are aligned with the internal & external organizational requirements

Profile:

- Bachelor or University degree

- Advanced knowledge of object-oriented architecture and design patterns for building highly scalable applications; with experience as Technical Lead for at least two full project lifecycles for a medium or large sized web-based application and Interface/API implementation.

- Minimum 5 years of experience in software development and multiple Web Technologies and framework including Java, .NET, ASP .Net, MVC, SQL Server and SharePoint.

- Minimum 2 years of experience in cloud solutions Architecture preferably in Azure.

- Knowledge of Angular JS, AJAX, HTML5, C#, web services, cloud design patterns, Artificial Intelligence and Blockchain Technology is nice to have;

- Excellent knowledge of English (both written and verbal) is required;

Offered:

​

- Challenging role for an international organization in Manila;

- Attractive salary package;

Interested:Please send you CV to: 

Details
